# Local-only external path overrides (this file is GITIGNORED — never commit
# your machine-specific paths). Copy this file to `local.env` at the repo root
# and fill in real paths. Keys use the SAME names as the environment variables,
# so `source local.env` in a shell exports identically to setting the vars.
#
# Resolution order (see docs/P597_PRIVATE_PATHS_AND_CLEAN_CLONE.md):
#   1. the environment variable (ALLEGIANCE_ARTWORK_PATH /
#      ALLEGIANCE_NATIVE_SRC_PATH)
#   2. this file (local.env at the repo root)
#   3. not found — product code fails with a clear, actionable message and the
#      corpus-backed tests SKIP (with a reason), rather than silently falling
#      back to an owner's machine path.
#
# Artwork corpus = the FreeAllegiance artwork checkout (clone it from
#   https://github.com/FreeAllegiance/Artwork ). Needed by the client, the
#   server, and the real-asset tests.
# REQUIRED: remove the leading '#' on the next line and set the real path.
#ALLEGIANCE_ARTWORK_PATH=/path/to/Artwork
#
# Native C++ Allegiance source checkout — a reference copy used by only a few
# native-parity tests. Not needed for the client/server to run.
#ALLEGIANCE_NATIVE_SRC_PATH=/path/to/Allegiance
#
# Optional SKY PACK — HD star field, nebula backdrops, deep-field galaxies and
#   distant/giant sky objects (NASA / ESA / Hubble / Webb imagery, credited in the
#   pack). Clone https://github.com/dominusbelial/AllegianceCore-sky and point this
#   at it (remove the leading '#'). When unset, the client simply skips those sky layers.
#ALLEGIANCE_SKY_PACK_PATH=/path/to/AllegianceCore-sky

# P601 — the PRIVATE optional Meshy asset pack (Meshy ships/textures removed from
#   the public repo). Point this at the pack root (its own private git repo, e.g.
#   ~/Development/AllegianceCore-meshy-pack) AFTER running its build.sh. When it
#   is absent/unset every hull renders native and Meshy options fall back cleanly.
#   See docs/P601_MESHY_PRIVATE_PACK.md.
#ALLEGIANCE_MESHY_PACK_PATH=/path/to/AllegianceCore-meshy-pack

# Optional private HD-1 native-UV PBR texture add-on. Missing/stale maps use native art.
#ALLEGIANCE_HD_PACK_PATH=/path/to/AllegianceCore-hd
